---
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How QuoteYeti collects, uses, and protects your data."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", url: "/" },
    { name: "Privacy Policy", url: "/privacy-policy/" },
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy <span class="serif-italic">policy</span></h1>
      <p class="page-hero__lede">
        Last updated: May 15, 2026. This policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use QuoteYeti.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container container--narrow legal-body">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you use QuoteYeti, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you provide:</strong> ZIP code, contact information, and other details you enter into our quote request forms.</li>
      <li><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited, referring URL, and timestamps. This is standard web analytics data.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> we use cookies to remember your preferences, measure site performance, and support marketing partnerships.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <p>We use your information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide and improve our services</li>
      <li>Match you with insurance carriers and agents in our partner network when you request quotes</li>
      <li>Communicate with you about your inquiries</li>
      <li>Send periodic newsletters and updates (only if you've subscribed)</li>
      <li>Analyze site usage and trends</li>
      <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Information sharing</h2>
    <p>When you submit a quote request, we share the information you provide with insurance carriers, agents, or marketing partners we have agreements with — so they can contact you with a quote. This is the basic mechanic of how quote comparison works.</p>
    <p>We don't sell your personal information to anyone outside this quote-sharing relationship. We don't share your information with random third parties.</p>
    <p>We may share aggregated, anonymized data (not personally identifiable) for analytics, marketing, or industry research purposes.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Opt out of marketing communications</strong> via the unsubscribe link in any email we send</li>
      <li><strong>Request a copy of your data</strong> by contacting <a href="mailto:privacy@quoteyeti.com">privacy@quoteyeti.com</a></li>
      <li><strong>Request deletion of your data</strong> (subject to legal retention requirements)</li>
      <li><strong>Refuse cookies</strong> in your browser settings (some site features may not work)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>California residents</h2>
    <p>Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) and CPRA, you have additional rights regarding your personal information: the right to know what we collect, the right to delete, the right to opt out of sale (we don't sell, but the right exists), and the right to non-discrimination for exercising these rights. Email <a href="mailto:privacy@quoteyeti.com">privacy@quoteyeti.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

    <h2>European Union residents</h2>
    <p>Under the GDPR, you have rights to access, rectify, delete, restrict processing, port, and object to processing of your personal data. Our lawful basis for processing is your consent and our legitimate interest in providing quote services you've requested.</p>

    <h2>Data security</h2>
    <p>We use industry-standard technical and organizational measures to protect your data. No method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, but we make reasonable efforts to protect information you share with us.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>QuoteYeti is not directed at children under 13. We don't knowingly collect information from children under 13. If you believe we have, contact us and we'll delete it.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We'll post any changes here with an updated "Last updated" date. Material changes will be communicated through our site or via email if you've subscribed.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this privacy policy? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@quoteyeti.com">privacy@quoteyeti.com</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <style>
    .page-hero {
      padding-block: var(--space-16) var(--space-10);
      background: var(--color-alice);
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2);
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--color-resolution);
      background: var(--color-white);
      padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    }
    .page-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }
    .serif-italic {
      font-family: var(--font-serif, "Plantin", Georgia, serif);
      font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-resolution);
    }
    .page-hero__lede {
      font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--color-text-strong);
      margin-top: var(--space-4); max-width: 720px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .container--narrow { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .legal-body {
      padding-block: var(--space-12) var(--space-20);
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .legal-body h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.375rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
      margin: var(--space-10) 0 var(--space-4);
      color: var(--color-resolution);
    }
    .legal-body h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .legal-body p { margin-bottom: var(--space-5); }
    .legal-body ul { margin-bottom: var(--space-5); padding-left: var(--space-6); }
    .legal-body li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
    .legal-body a {
      color: var(--color-resolution);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
